{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/821434e99ef05bd902f99d5f933e5280.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/821434e99ef05bd902f99d5f933e5280.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/821434e99ef05bd902f99d5f933e5280.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S.E.M.I.</strong> is a cooperative online game about escaping from a special clinic. Here, <strong>you and up to 3 of your</strong> <span class=\"bb_strike\">brainless</span> <strong>loyal friends</strong> play as patients, fighting staff and other patients while stumbling into all sorts of unexpected situations.\u00a0<strong>Brawls, side-effect pills, and brutal platforming will absolutely challenge your <span class=\"bb_strike\">clumsy friends\u2019 hands</span> sense of teamwork.\u00a0</strong>Expect obstacles, puzzles, deadly traps, and rooms where a single wrong move can knock out the entire squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/acd927b3dc90daee7a45d5eab45e2aa6.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/acd927b3dc90daee7a45d5eab45e2aa6.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/acd927b3dc90daee7a45d5eab45e2aa6.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate in voice chat and <span class=\"bb_strike\">arrange sabotage</span>\u00a0help your friends pass through rooms, get out of traps and fight with opponents! In your arsenal: close combat, physics, amazing abilities and ... imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bdcb7eb83451033ff4f75dfc6bf8bea9.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bdcb7eb83451033ff4f75dfc6bf8bea9.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bdcb7eb83451033ff4f75dfc6bf8bea9.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pills and get <strong>abilities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bipolar force</strong> is an invulnerable monster, then a helpless rag!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser astigmatism</strong> \u2014 two sights, one laser\u2026 Where will he shoot?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stendhal syndrome</strong> \u2014 are you looking at a painting? Now you're hysterical and destroying everything around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice's syndrome</strong> is either tiny or gigantic \u2014 have time to adjust!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bb471c64a80141e16255c4912a863d3f.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bb471c64a80141e16255c4912a863d3f.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bb471c64a80141e16255c4912a863d3f.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madness is near! You and your friends can go crazy and start running, jumping and fighting, and your abilities will become uncontrollable. Do you want to take back control? <strong>Take the pills :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/807d1f535e9c2dd9d6821cdb527e4862.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/807d1f535e9c2dd9d6821cdb527e4862.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/807d1f535e9c2dd9d6821cdb527e4862.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are randomly generated from rooms with changing gravity, traps, moving walls, and other &quot;pleasant&quot; surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/d4d399a5735cfe936fc8c993d25a6913.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/d4d399a5735cfe936fc8c993d25a6913.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/d4d399a5735cfe936fc8c993d25a6913.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful escape, you will receive a medical report: &quot;<i>The patient was stable until he started hitting the guards with a bottle. Diagnosis: Overmotivation</i>&quot; or something <strong>worse</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/661023925292b2a0021a9af26a15e2a1.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/661023925292b2a0021a9af26a15e2a1.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/661023925292b2a0021a9af26a15e2a1.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new costumes and decorations. Let each new escape be more stylish than the previous one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you and your friends be able to escape... or at least not go crazy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mental hospital! Here, your abilities are a lottery, and your friends can be the most dangerous opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957560?t=1769186824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957560?t=1769186824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/5a39dee45c9ea97d5719e2f8ce768b811c30b24e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769186824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/5a39dee45c9ea97d5719e2f8ce768b811c30b24e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769186824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/821434e99ef05bd902f99d5f933e5280.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/821434e99ef05bd902f99d5f933e5280.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/821434e99ef05bd902f99d5f933e5280.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S.E.M.I.</strong> is a cooperative online game about escaping from a special clinic. Here, <strong>you and up to 3 of your</strong> <span class=\"bb_strike\">brainless</span> <strong>loyal friends</strong> play as patients, fighting staff and other patients while stumbling into all sorts of unexpected situations.\u00a0<strong>Brawls, side-effect pills, and brutal platforming will absolutely challenge your <span class=\"bb_strike\">clumsy friends\u2019 hands</span> sense of teamwork.\u00a0</strong>Expect obstacles, puzzles, deadly traps, and rooms where a single wrong move can knock out the entire squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f664545e2705de4d74ee94e3d1d5a4c1.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/acd927b3dc90daee7a45d5eab45e2aa6.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/acd927b3dc90daee7a45d5eab45e2aa6.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/acd927b3dc90daee7a45d5eab45e2aa6.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate in voice chat and <span class=\"bb_strike\">arrange sabotage</span>\u00a0help your friends pass through rooms, get out of traps and fight with opponents! In your arsenal: close combat, physics, amazing abilities and ... imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/b311c0faccfb97d07513d1471fc27578.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bdcb7eb83451033ff4f75dfc6bf8bea9.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bdcb7eb83451033ff4f75dfc6bf8bea9.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bdcb7eb83451033ff4f75dfc6bf8bea9.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pills and get <strong>abilities</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bipolar force</strong> is an invulnerable monster, then a helpless rag!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser astigmatism</strong> \u2014 two sights, one laser\u2026 Where will he shoot?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stendhal syndrome</strong> \u2014 are you looking at a painting? Now you're hysterical and destroying everything around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice's syndrome</strong> is either tiny or gigantic \u2014 have time to adjust!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/864e2e2639d47341f346533df3caab49.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bb471c64a80141e16255c4912a863d3f.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bb471c64a80141e16255c4912a863d3f.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/bb471c64a80141e16255c4912a863d3f.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madness is near! You and your friends can go crazy and start running, jumping and fighting, and your abilities will become uncontrollable. Do you want to take back control? <strong>Take the pills :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/035e56d32c149e64f9a141b3975227bb.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/807d1f535e9c2dd9d6821cdb527e4862.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/807d1f535e9c2dd9d6821cdb527e4862.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/807d1f535e9c2dd9d6821cdb527e4862.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are randomly generated from rooms with changing gravity, traps, moving walls, and other &quot;pleasant&quot; surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/a8729c840f0f99a7499019a152352b83.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/d4d399a5735cfe936fc8c993d25a6913.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/d4d399a5735cfe936fc8c993d25a6913.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/d4d399a5735cfe936fc8c993d25a6913.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful escape, you will receive a medical report: &quot;<i>The patient was stable until he started hitting the guards with a bottle. Diagnosis: Overmotivation</i>&quot; or something <strong>worse</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f1be3f7d083e4ac27aa1151d6429b5b8.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/661023925292b2a0021a9af26a15e2a1.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/661023925292b2a0021a9af26a15e2a1.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/661023925292b2a0021a9af26a15e2a1.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new costumes and decorations. Let each new escape be more stylish than the previous one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.poster.avif?t=1769186824\" width=616 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.webm?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/extras/f3d76d9d8a4be04234da5bebf94ef7d3.mp4?t=1769186824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you and your friends be able to escape... or at least not go crazy?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mental hospital! Here, your abilities are a lottery, and your friends can be the most dangerous opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Two Horn Unicorn"],"dlc":[4259150,4259160,4268070],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957560/f21928e252cb7cf797dda931b49e48a6c51b7b9c/header.jpg?t=1769186824","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>",